<trk>
    <name>01 OUTBOUND - planning corridor to NE couloir notch</name>
    <cmt>UNVERIFIED PLANNING LINE; see metadata and waypoint descriptions.</cmt>
    <desc>Mapped summer-trail access plus approximate off-trail ski corridor. Snow travel need not follow trail switchbacks. Creek crossings, lake margins, headwall passages and the couloir require field decisions. The return is an exact reversal for itinerary planning, not an independently recorded descent.</desc>
    <type>ski touring - approximate plan</type>
